    "description": "Market square, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). Over budget: 620 blocks vs 221 (15 x 15 instead of 11 x 11, so four full stalls fit). Flush piece (ground_layer 0: the paving replaces the grass; the mod's builders can't do that yet). A paved square (stone brick border, cobblestone, gravel aisles in from all four sides) with four market stalls (the market stall design, red-white and brown-white awnings) round a stepped stone market cross; benches face the cross. L2: the cross head with lanterns, stalls open for trade, a weighing scale (lectern), a strongbox, banner poles and lantern posts at the entrances. L3: flower beds round the cross, banners on the stall backs, stall stools and banners, goods stacked at the sides. Decoration step adds: sign_text.",
